                                                "sense_id": "8e44f988-4ede-330d-b303-5d8904952aac",
                                                "text": "1887, George Gissing, Thyrza\nThere was organic disease, and there was what is vaguely called nervous breakdown; it was too clear that Mr. Newthorpe must count upon very moderate activity either of mind or body henceforth."
                                            },
                                            {
