                                                "sense_id": "8e44f988-4ede-330d-b303-5d8904952aac",
                                                "text": "1915, P. G. Wodehouse, Something New\n...will you kindly think up at your earliest convenience some plan for politely ejecting this Mr Chalmers of yours from our humble home?--because if you don't, I'm going to have a nervous breakdown."
